      "height": 244,
      "help": "WaveShaper simulates analogue wave shaping. Polynomial mode sums coefficients of x through x^6. Sines sums harmonics 1, 4, 7, 10, 13 and 16 of sin(pi*x). The six knobs range from -1 to +1. The transfer curve shows input horizontally and output vertically, both from -1 to +1. Curves exceeding unit amplitude are normalised, as in the DSP. Input is clipped to this range.",
